261
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,070
Ah! Ah!

262
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,800
Kirito...

263
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:14,760
Oh, oh...

264
00:22:16,620 --> 00:22:20,540
